<description>&lt;p&gt;The International Court of Justice has found Myanmar guilty of genocide against the Rohingya, prompting the U.K. to sanction five senior Myanmar military officials. Malaysia is repatriating another 6,803 Myanmar nationals despite the ruling. Myanmar’s armed forces continue to use landmines, with the country recording the world’s highest landmine casualty toll for a third consecutive year. A rebel fighter lost a leg to a landmine but vowed to return to the front line with a prosthetic limb. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/news/audio/2026/nov/24/myanmar-found-guilty-genocide-should-israel-be-worried-podcast&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNM0Fta1BkcGNCQ3ZRMmRYZ055QmhtMjNuQW83d0hUbWJEOGo3SmloTmdENnZmdFQwS0ptVlRFWGFocS1BNGhSNm1xMGdPdEpSVnA1Z0FjY0YwTkVObnctcS01WXRleXlxZUJNRk1zYU9YNlZRcFZJNm1OcklnczhRbzBfc1ROeFJDSmxhMm9LOUNBeEtEd3p2NVlfamo?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQdjFkZ2JDbm9zS191dGVPU01XcElTSW1xNEVmbG5vbGRCZC1aaDhyRS1uazQ5bkFvZ2lvcVhWRGxxVTlYUTBpUUVtWktteTRSdFFkQ0R1cG5UdXQtUWVtTzF6UURfN0dzN3RvV0gtMVZ3Q2hPYmhRUVdlQWo0Z3VuMEI4LUZoMWZnaFZBMGxDekdyN2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crisisgroup.org/qna/asia-pacific/myanmar/world-court-finds-myanmar-committed-genocide-against-rohingya&quot;&gt;International Crisis Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOY0I2bkp6LUNBVmFsQTVEd21qLUNHZVJJWWF3dDFaYnBWLXF6TU9fdV9pWVljUmpPb2hOVmsxcU1USjBxNlVVZVVlMGRONy1fUWNTQmVfelJ5YWZwUTExampxclg2QUQtQndnNkFhb3dFUUgtclRNZU0xbkM1RUJheWJOMlU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Min